loc('Non-Chinese citizen; friendly to China, no criminal record, obey Chinese laws and host rules, good physical/mental health and academic/behavioral standing, interested in Chinese language education and related work. Age16–35 on 1 September2026, extended to45 for in-service Chinese teachers.','非中国籍，对华友好、无犯罪记录，遵守中国法律及校规，身心健康、品学兼优，有志于中文教育及相关工作；以2026年9月1日计年龄16–35岁，在职中文教师可放宽至45岁。'),
loc('For International Chinese Language Education, Chinese Language and Literature, Chinese History or Chinese Philosophy, HSK Level3 at least180 plus an HSKK report is required. For Traditional Chinese Medicine or Taiji Culture, an HSK report is required and HSKK is preferred; this alternative is not assigned the other directions’ HSK3 threshold. Test reports are valid for two years.','国际中文教育、汉语言文学、中国历史、中国哲学方向要求HSK三级至少180分并具有HSKK成绩；中医和太极文化方向要求HSK成绩，提供HSKK者优先，不将其他方向的HSK三级门槛套用于此分支。成绩报告有效期两年。'),
